From 86ad39c37ac223168733d6711da9c2f38b49c4cd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Oleksii Zakharov <contact@zalexdev.com>
Date: Sun, 16 Aug 2026 11:28:15 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] um: arm64: update the README for the three fixes found on
 hardware

Records what running the port on two phones turned up: pointer
authentication left enabled in the stub, FP/SIMD state never crossing a
signal in SECCOMP mode, and PTRS_PER_PTE not following PAGE_SHIFT. Also
corrects the rss-counter entry, which was listed as unexplained and is a
consequence of the last of those.

Signed-off-by: Oleksii Zakharov <contact@zalexdev.com>
---
